
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-dps 1.2 --- status: recommended

This are the binaries for the dvips driver. A program that translates
.dvi files into postscript files. The package also contains some metric
files for postscript fonts. You can configure divps with the file
/usr/lib/texmf/dvips/config.ps for your own printer. Dvips can also help
you to print files on a printer for which no dvi driver is provided.
Translate the dvi file to a postscript file and print it with ghostscript.
(Ghostscript is not included in this distribution.) The current version
of dvipsk (the 'k' idicates that the sources use the kpathsea library) 
is 5.58a using the kpathsea library 2.1. This package also contains the 
epsf and the psfig macros for including eps-format files in LaTeX documents.

